# Q-231: keep text inputs LF on Windows checkouts (autocrlf would change hashed JSON/config, break bash scripts and .meta/asset YAML).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.cs text eol=lf
*.asmdef text eol=lf
*.meta text eol=lf
*.asset text eol=lf
*.unity text eol=lf
*.prefab text eol=lf
*.mat text eol=lf
*.shader text eol=lf
*.hlsl text eol=lf
*.compute text eol=lf
*.cginc text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
